    "text": "Title of the create option on the empty screen of the Knowledge bases list in the AI Chat section, shown above a one-line description; clicking it opens the form that creates a knowledge base. Short label, adjective + noun, no verb, no full stop. Knowledge base = a room of files the assistant searches; the adjective agrees with it. Match Common:CreateKnowledgeBase.",
